    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d851">

                <pb facs="0712" n="636" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg636"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.516/125</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Representative Rodgers to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexico City</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-07-31T16:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 31, 1916, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>250. Department’s 248, July 28, 4 p.m. This same contribution mentioned in my
                    209, July 5, 3 p.m.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d851-f1"/> Banks refused to pay. On
                    behalf of American banks secured from Cabrera July 22 agreement suspension
                    proceedings in enforcement payment contribution. No action since and advised
                    compromises somewhat satisfactory to al] banks will be effected soon.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rodgers</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
